22:### WEDDING CEREMONY OPTIONS
23-
24:Choose from a range of gorgeous locations to have your ceremony – from ancient trees, to picturesque dams with lily pads and ivy covered gazebos (keep scrolling to see photos). Style the ceremony your way – choose from our included arbors or bring your own.
