30:### WEDDING RECEPTION OPTIONS
31-
32:If you’re planning a bigger outdoor wedding, choose a tipi or marquee package for your rainforest surrounded reception. Our tipis bring a fun festival vibe, and our marquees are a glamourous garden party option.
33-
36:We get it, your pets are your family – of course they should be a part of your big day! Incorporate your fur babies into your ceremony and reception however you see fit. Read our wedding blogs from our dog friendly venue.
