60:For convenient and affordable elopement packages on the Gold Coast, check out our intimate wedding package & mid week elopement package. Perfect for celebrating your love with your closest friends and family, without the fuss!
61-
64:“If you’re looking for a beautiful hinterland wedding venue, look not further! Gold coast farmhouse is the most stunning venue, from the minute you walk in you can see how beautiful and well maintained the property is and how incredible the views around are. This secluded little property was beyond amazing for our wedding in May, we had an intimate wedding on the old Queenslander deck and we honestly can’t recommend enough. The farmhouse team are incredible at what they do and go above and beyond to help you create the perfect day! You won’t regret booking your wedding at this amazing venue!”
65-
68:“We just wanted to send you a quick email to say a massive thank you for making our wedding day so amazing. Choosing Gold Coast Farm House as our wedding venue was easily one of the best decisions we made. It was the perfect place for our wedding and everything ran smoothly thanks to your team’s exceptional service. Krystal was fantastic and she was always ready to ensure everything ran smoothly. Thank you for being so accommodating to our needs and for all your help. Overall, we couldn’t have asked for a better wedding venue, and we feel so lucky to have found Gold Coast Farm House!”
69-
72:“The Gold Coast Farm House is the most stunning venue. My husband and I got married in January and we could not have had a more spectacular day. The venue is a beautifully manicured, vast and open space, it is not overly decorated just simply beautiful. The photos were incredible. I loved that the team allowed us complete freedom to build the wedding of our dreams rather than being bound by packages and numbers. We could choose all our vendors and the GCFH team were more than happy to support any of our visions!! I love that no wedding would be the same at this venue as the couple get’s to choose and build their day from scratch! Wish we could do it all again!”
