93:## PAGE [wedding]: https://goldcoastfarmhouse.com.au/about-us/
94-
105:The large deck can hold up to 40 people seated for an intimate wedding or a large family gathering. We have 4 different wedding ceremony locations to choose from – point of the dam, jetty over the dam, gazebo and under our beautiful 100 year old tree.
106-
107:Our marquee or tipi site is large and level, beautifully positioned next to our dam and can accommodate up to 150 guests depending on the number of tipis you choose or the size of your marquee.
108-
109:Gold Coast Farm House is private and secluded, your guests will be so surprised when they come down the driveway and around the corner and look out across the dam and your beautiful reception.
110-
114:Their experience with interior design and love for all things vintage led them to lovingly restore and transform the vast rural space into a stunning country wedding venue.
115-
122:While Marcia and Jeff are still very hands-on with maintaining and enhancing the property, they have handed over bookings and venue coordination to the wider Farm House team. Experienced and approachable, the team works closely with couples and wedding planners to ensure every detail is perfectly organised for a seamless ceremony and reception.
