313-
314:Spend your money wisely, on what matters most to you – this could be an extravagant menu, killer music, beautiful flowers or your honeymoon. Celebrate your day with your closest loved ones with a simple elopement and grand dinner on the deck of our beautiful restored Queenslander home. This intimate space gives you the freedom to dine as you desire and take in beautiful views of the Numinbah Valley.
315-
318:Celebrate your way with your closest loved ones and your choice of ceremony space. The money you save on a midweek elopement you can splurge on that dreamy photographer and videographer or a long honeymoon. With full access to the entire 60-acre property so you can explore and play.
319-
322:Don’t worry about finding enough tables and chairs, or where to set up your bar. We will take care of set up and pack up, so you can relax and enjoy your day. While most furniture is included in your package, you can also check out our styling hire to add to your special day.
